- [x] **Phase 1**: Architecture, repository setup, database schema, Alembic migrations, RLS policies, and deterministic seed data
- [x] **Phase 2**: Supabase authentication, trusted user/hospital resolution, and tenant isolation
- [ ] **Phase 3**: RBAC, user permission overrides, constraints, and access-management safeguards
- [ ] **Phase 4**: Operation registry, typed schemas, repository layer, and Python business logic
